    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Crowley are delighted to bring to the market this impressive five bedroom detached property, set on an elevated south facing site offering panoramic views across Clew Bay and some of its islands to Croagh Patrick.\n\nThe spacious and well proportioned house was built circa 2000. Some of its quality finishes include timber floors and a beech kitchen. The floor area extends to approximately 225.2 sq m (2,424 sq ft). It would make a superb family residence or an exceptional home away from home holiday retreat. \n\nOn the ground floor, there is a large entrance hall, a light filled living room featuring east, south and west facing windows to maximise the sea and island views and catch day long sunlight. The dining room also benefits from dual aspect sea views and opens into the well appointed kitchen with an adjoining utility room. The main bedroom has south facing patio doors overlooking the sea, a roomy walk in wardrobe and an en-suite shower room. \n\nOn the first floor there are four double bedrooms (three with en-suite shower rooms) and a bathroom. The bedrooms all have wonderful sea or mountain views. \n\nExternally, the gardens measure approximately 0.69 of an acre fronted by stone walls and wrought iron gates. There are extensive lawns to the front and side, a steeltech shed and a tarmac driveway with ample parking to the rear of the house. \n\nSandhill is a peaceful countryside area, located 8.5 km from Mulranny, an attractive coastal village on the Wild Atlantic Way, whose many amenities include primary and pre schools, a Blue Flag Beach, hotel, restaurants/ bars, shops, playground and nine hole golf course. It is a 10 km drive to Newport, a small town with a good range of facilities including primary school, shops, restaurants/bars and hotel. The award winning Nevins Bar & Restaurant is situated 2 km from the house and one of Mayo's finest leisure facilities, The Great Western Greenway cycle/walking trail running from Westport to Achill Island, is just 1 km away. \n\nOffers in Excess of 495,000\n\nDirections:\nFrom Newport take the Mulranny/Achill road for approximately 9 km and turn left, continue for 600 metres then keep right and the house is on the right after 300 metres"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.42m x 2.18m & 3.1m x 2.93m\nTiled floor, pine staircase\n\nLiving Room - 5.78m x 4.49m\nTriple aspect windows with panoramic sea, island and mountain views, oak floor, two sets of patio doors to front garden, part double height ceiling with feature south facing arched window, marble fireplace with gas fire, curtains\n\nDining Room (currently used as second living room) - 5.16m x 3.95m & 2.14m x 1.08m\nDual aspect south and west facing windows with panoramic sea, island and mountain views, oak floor, patio doors to side garden, curtains\n\nKitchen - 4.46m x 4.06m\nTiled floor, beech kitchen with integrated oven, gas hob and dishwasher\n\nUtility Room - 2.99m x 2.67m\nTiled floor, built in units with sink, oil central heating boiler, door to rear garden\n\nBedroom One - 4.02m x 3.98m & 1.88m x 0.96m\nBright dual aspect room with wonderful sea views, pine floor, patio doors to front garden, curtains\n\nEn-Suite - 1.75m x 1.67m\nFully tiled, shower, wc, whb\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2.88m x 1.99m\nPine floor, built in hanging rails and shelving\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 2.09m x 0.95m & 2.84m x 1.93m\nPine floor, attic access\n\nBedroom Two - 4.39m x 3.96m & 2.12m x 0.45m\nDual aspect windows with sea, Clare Island and mountain views, pine floor, curtains\n\nEn - Suite - 2.19m x 1.71m & 1.69m x 0.79m & 1.39m x 0.89m\nVinyl flooring, part tiled walls, shower, wc, whb, velux window\n\nBedroom Three - 4.48m x 3.33m\nPine flooring, Nephin Mountain views, curtains\n\nEn-Suite - 3.76m x 1.92m\nVinyl flooring, part tiled walls, shower, wc, whb, velux window\n\nBedroom Four - 4.01m x 3.07m\nPine floor, mountain views, curtains\n\nEn-Suite - 2.39m x 1.55m\nVinyl flooring, part tiled walls, shower, wc, whb, velux window\n\nBedroom Five - 4.02m x 3.28m\nPine floor, dual aspect windows with sea and mountain views, curtains\n\nBathroom - 3.0m x 2.15m\nVinyl flooring, part tiled walls, bath with electric shower, wc, whb, velux window\n\nHotpress - 1.18m x 0.95\nShelved\n\n"
      },
